  "releaseNotes": "### Conversations and projects\n\n- Browse conversation history with a turn outline, previews, and direct navigation to earlier turns.\n- Manage approved folders per conversation and review changes in a unified diff view.\n\n### Browser and context\n\n- Improve browser navigation and element interaction, including selection from native dropdowns.\n- Improve the handling of images in long conversations and compacted context.\n\n### Upgrade notes\n\n- This release uses Core protocol 63 and upgrades the database to schema 61. Keep the pre-upgrade backup if you need to return to an earlier version.\n- Windows availability follows Microsoft Store certification and rollout.",
